      fee: 'FE $225; PE $400 (2026 NCEES fees for U.S. examinees). State application, licence and any state-specific exam fees are charged separately by the board',
      format: 'Computer-based testing (CBT). FE is offered year-round; most PE disciplines are now year-round CBT, while a few low-volume disciplines and PE Structural are still offered on fixed dates. Both exams are closed-book with a searchable electronic NCEES Reference Handbook supplied on-screen'
